          "sourceToXnb": "EffectSourceCommandLineTest.AnFxInASourceTreeIsAnAssetRatherThanBeingSilentlyIgnored, EffectSourceCommandLineTest.TheCompiledBytesTheCompilerReturnedReachTheXnbUnchanged",
          "sourceToCnb": "EffectSourceCommandLineTest.AnFxAskedForCnbIsRefusedWithTheArchitecturalReason",
